[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4647287297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120075#issuecomment-4647287297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120075","id":4647287297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFP_6AQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T09:27:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T09:27:30Z","body":"Please upload an MRP to make this easier to test and replicate your specific case, the reproduction steps are very vague and might be hard to dial in so it helps a lot to have an MRP","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4647287297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649325851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120075#issuecomment-4649325851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120075","id":4649325851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFR8VGw","user":{"login":"smsc7","id":262471743,"node_id":"U_kgDOD6UAPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262471743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7","html_url":"https://github.com/smsc7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T13:12:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T13:12:29Z","body":"Enabling keep y velocity doesn't let the NavigationAgent3D have some grace in its Y position so what ends up happening is that if the agent is far from the NavigationRegion3D it'll internally still try to go up causing the hitches you'll see as the agent tries to go from the middle to the sides.\nDisabling it and overriding the y velocity after the fact also doesn't solve it as it'll still slow down on X and Z,\n\nThe end result is that you need a really precise NavigationRegion3D and path_height_offset to be able to maintain the velocity that you set on the X and Z.\nWithout avoidance you can get the array of the path positions and manually allow for some range of grace in the Y position, however if you want to use avoidance you can't do this as far as i know? \n\nWhat I'm asking for is either a way to fully allow to ignore the Y position even internally or to allow for some grace on the Y position that way even if the NavigationRegion3D is simple in polygons and not entirely set at the right height your agents will still move accordingly in the X and Z.\n\n(the navigation region on the test has its height slightly up on purpose, being above the height of the character body to show minimally and fast what I'm talking about with keep y velocity)\n[mrp-velocity.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28708401/mrp-velocity.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649325851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649377926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120075#issuecomment-4649377926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120075","id":4649377926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFR_ghg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T13:18:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T13:18:09Z","body":"This sounds more like a feature request than a bug report from your description, if that's the case I'd say that a proposal should be opened [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) instead","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649377926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649493694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120075#issuecomment-4649493694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120075","id":4649493694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFSGkvg","user":{"login":"smsc7","id":262471743,"node_id":"U_kgDOD6UAPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262471743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7","html_url":"https://github.com/smsc7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smsc7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T13:31:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T13:31:48Z","body":"I'm open to making a proposal but I feel like this should be treated like a bug and sort of urgent? This is a very common problem many people have when dealing with the navigation in 3D, many reddit posts and youtube comments under tutorials have asked about how to solve this when the terrain gets moderately complex.\n\nThis would make it easier for everyone by default without having to use hacky or complex solutions.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649493694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649557411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120075#issuecomment-4649557411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120075","id":4649557411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFSKdow","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T13:39:29Z","u